# Prior Art

**[Ligolo-ng](https://github.com/nicocha30/ligolo-ng)** — TUN-based Layer 3 tunneling for network pivoting.

**[Chisel](https://github.com/jpillora/chisel)** — TCP/UDP tunneling over WebSockets.

**[Proxychains](https://github.com/haad/proxychains)** — Routing connections through proxy chains.
